      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        283.38238525390625,
        290.80999755859375,
        297.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "services without experiencing financial hardship.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        311.27239990234375,
        324.19610595703125,
        325.62738037109375
      ],
      "text": "Women (breastfeeding, pregnant, postpartum):",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        324.2134094238281,
        311.38238525390625,
        527.4296875,
        325.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "the terms breastfeeding, pregnant or",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        325.3824157714844,
        527.4432373046875,
        339.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "postpartum women are used here given that the majority of data are disaggregated by sex and do",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        339.3824157714844,
        527.4411010742188,
        353.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "not specify gender identity. However, the term “woman” is intended to be inclusive of all those who",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        353.3824157714844,
        527.37841796875,
        367.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "identify as women and/or who give birth. While the majority of persons who are or can give birth",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        367.3824157714844,
        527.4408569335938,
        381.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "are cisgender women (who were born and identify as female), WHO acknowledges the importance",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        381.3824157714844,
        527.3738403320312,
        395.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "of the experiences of transgender men and other gender diverse people who have the reproductive",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
